====Usage notes====
* Because ''cheap'' is {{l|en|polysemic|polysemically}} ambiguous, it is not always clear whether the intended meaning is ''inexpensive'', ''poorly made'', or both; apt word choice, with terms such as {{m|en|good value}} or {{m|en|shoddy}}, can clarify.

